[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2485882018","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99228#issuecomment-2485882018","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99228","id":2485882018,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UK4yi","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-19T14:32:18Z","updated_at":"2024-11-19T14:33:11Z","body":"Should be fixed in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99426.\r\n\r\nThe problem was a bit complex, but basically there was a wrong dependency detection if the following steps were taken:\r\n- The render target is used as a uniform texture for sampling (first viewport).\r\n- The render target is switched to a color attachment, but the first draw list that does so didn't cover the entire area (shadow rendering for second viewport).\r\n- The next draw lists would fail to detect an intersection and wouldn't insert themselves as being dependent on the transition caused by the previous step. Therefore, the shadow rendering of the second viewport was being done before the first viewport was rendered, overwriting the shadow rendering performed for the first viewport.\r\n\r\nSo this problem popped up often with resources shared between subviewports, as it reuses the same atlas and therefore causes a dependency on the writes.\r\n\r\nThere's potential to optimize this to do more drawing in parallel if different textures are used per sub viewport! But that's outside the scope of my fix and something the canvas renderer would have to detect if it's worth doing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2485882018/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2485997213","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99228#issuecomment-2485997213","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99228","id":2485997213,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ULU6d","user":{"login":"timoschwarzer","id":8849554,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDk1NTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8849554?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer","html_url":"https://github.com/timoschwarzer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-19T15:14:55Z","updated_at":"2024-11-19T15:14:55Z","body":"Thanks a lot! :heart: ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2485997213/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2486965444","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99228#issuecomment-2486965444","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99228","id":2486965444,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UPBTE","user":{"login":"timoschwarzer","id":8849554,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDk1NTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8849554?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer","html_url":"https://github.com/timoschwarzer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-19T23:26:33Z","updated_at":"2024-11-19T23:26:33Z","body":"Unfortunately, there are still problems with shadows in multiple viewports. @Calinou please re-open this issue as I don't have permission to do s